  <div class="story-text">

    <p class="s-tag">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open" style="margin-right:6px"></i>
      Our Story
    </p>

    <h2>Why Leptozan Was Created</h2>

    <p>
      Healthy weight management is often the result of consistent lifestyle choices rather than quick solutions. Leptozan was developed for adults looking to complement balanced nutrition, regular exercise, and everyday wellness with a convenient dietary supplement that fits naturally into daily life.
    </p>

    <p>
      From the beginning, our goal has been to focus on ingredient quality, transparency, and responsible product information. Every aspect of Leptozan is designed to help customers better understand the formula, make informed purchasing decisions, and confidently include nutritional support in their long-term wellness routine.
    </p>

    <p>
      We believe that trust is earned through consistency, accurate information, and customer satisfaction. That's why Leptozan continues to emphasize carefully selected ingredients, quality-focused manufacturing standards, and a customer-first approach that supports informed wellness choices without unrealistic promises.
    </p>

    <div class="trust-strip" style="margin-top:20px">
      <span class="trust-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-award"></i> Premium Quality</span>
      <span class="trust-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-flask"></i> Carefully Selected Ingredients</span>
      <span class="trust-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-heart"></i> Everyday Wellness Support</span>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

