    <div class="about-faq-list faq-list">

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          What is Leptozan?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          Leptozan is a daily dietary supplement created with a blend of carefully selected botanical ingredients. It is designed to complement healthy lifestyle habits and support individuals pursuing balanced nutrition, healthy metabolism, and long-term wellness goals through convenient daily supplementation.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          What makes Leptozan different from similar supplements?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
